WEBVTT

00:21.329 --> 00:28.192
I'm

00:28.232 --> 00:31.954
typing out the coordinates on the terminal

00:31.974 --> 00:32.594
screen.

00:35.576 --> 00:39.678
The cleanest set of numbers that I've ever seen.

00:42.319 --> 00:46.341
I know you're out there burning in the asteroid

00:46.462 --> 00:47.062
field.

00:49.523 --> 00:53.125
I know you're pushing hard against the broken

00:53.305 --> 00:53.946
shield.

00:56.427 --> 00:59.909
But I'm standing in the center of the quiet and

00:59.989 --> 01:00.930
the clear.

01:03.571 --> 01:07.414
I'm sending out a signal just to let you know I'm

01:07.514 --> 01:08.114
here.

01:11.040 --> 01:14.083
The radar is sweeping, the sequence is locked.

01:14.583 --> 01:17.646
The data is streaming, the channel is docked.

01:18.187 --> 01:20.749
Across the dark vacuum, across the great

01:20.789 --> 01:24.113
divide, a burst of information from the other

01:24.253 --> 01:29.377
side. Telemetry! Pinching in the dots Shooting

01:29.577 --> 01:33.359
out a message like a digital spark Telemetry

01:33.979 --> 01:37.441
Reading out the lines Looking at the numbers and

01:37.481 --> 01:41.684
decoding the signs I won't let you pull me I won't

01:41.704 --> 01:47.047
let you drag me down But I'll send you the

01:47.087 --> 01:50.089
telemetry from my side of town

01:57.049 --> 02:01.351
I can see a friction burning up the atmosphere.

02:03.732 --> 02:07.034
You're running on the edge, you're running on

02:07.174 --> 02:07.894
the gear.

02:10.376 --> 02:14.198
But I am in the Goldilocks, the temperature is

02:14.338 --> 02:14.898
right.

02:17.439 --> 02:21.101
I'm just a glowing beacon in the middle of your

02:21.121 --> 02:21.241
night.

02:25.041 --> 02:28.744
Data, read the math, adjust your heavy spin

02:31.406 --> 02:35.089
But I am keeping the perimeter, you cannot enter

02:35.109 --> 02:35.149
in

02:38.851 --> 02:41.874
The radar is sweeping, the sequence is locked.

02:42.354 --> 02:45.377
The data is streaming, the channel is docked.

02:45.917 --> 02:48.479
Across the dark vacuum, across the great

02:48.499 --> 02:51.802
divide, a burst of information from the other

02:51.942 --> 02:57.026
side. Telemetry, pinging in the dark, shooting

02:57.227 --> 03:01.010
out a message like a digital spark. Telemetry,

03:01.550 --> 03:05.035
Reading up the lines, looking at the numbers and

03:05.055 --> 03:08.921
decoding the signs I won't let you pull me, I

03:09.001 --> 03:11.064
won't let you drag me down

03:13.327 --> 03:17.172
But I'll send you the telemetry from my side of

03:17.232 --> 03:17.573
town

03:48.681 --> 03:56.645
Signal out. Signal received. The distances

03:56.765 --> 04:00.467
maintained. The sanctuary.

04:02.188 --> 04:02.708
The G.

04:05.388 --> 04:10.351
Telemetry, pinging in the dark Shooting out a

04:10.411 --> 04:13.973
message like a digital spark Telemetry,

04:14.553 --> 04:17.976
reading up the lines Looking at the numbers and

04:18.016 --> 04:21.258
decoding the signs I won't let you pull me, I

04:21.858 --> 04:27.442
won't let you drag me down But I'll send you the

04:27.502 --> 04:30.504
telemetry from my side of town

04:33.737 --> 04:38.643
Signal out. End transmission.

04:40.685 --> 04:41.626
Telemetry.

